# RECSEEKERS Website — Developer Handoff

**Repo:** `https://github.com/RECSEEKERS/RECSEEKERS-Website`
**Documented from:** `main` @ `3448ecb` (2026-05-20) — see [§9 Branch state](#9-branch-state--git-notes), because **`main` is not the current line of development**.
**Prepared:** August 2026

This document exists so a developer who has never seen this codebase can open it, understand what every file does, run it, change content, and ship it. It is deliberately blunt about the rough edges — see [§8](#8-known-issues--todos).

